[00:24.09]1. Great God, Jehovah, you are deserving,
[00:29.32]Worthy of the highest praise,
[00:34.54]Good and just in all your ways.
[00:40.36]You have such power, deep love, and wisdom.
[00:49.36]You are God to endless days.
[01:16.70]2. Father, we feel your tender compassion.
[01:25.82]We are dust, and still you care;
[01:29.82]Graciously you hear our prayer.
[01:34.82]How you sustain us, teach us, and guide us!
[01:43.82]Help from you is always there.
[02:21.21]3. Heaven and earth now sing of your glory.
[02:25.69]Joyfully with voices raised,
[02:30.37]We exalt you all our days.
[02:35.90]Great God, Jehovah, you are deserving.
[02:43.64]Please accept our heartfelt praise.